<title>GERMANY: German inland gas oil strengthens on demand, IPEs.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil strengthens on demand, IPEs.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.5098)  DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     37.00/37.60     24.50/24.90     36.60/36.80</p>
<p> BREMEN		37.00/37.60     24.50/24.90     36.60/36.80</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    38.10/38.60     25.23/25.56     37.80/38.00</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   39.30/39.50     26.03/26.16     39.00/39.20</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   39.50/40.20     26.16/26.62     39.20/39.60</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  40.50/40.90     26.82/27.08     40.20/40.80</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices surged on Wednesday as IPE futures soared and household demand picked up. Refiners said they were limiting the volume they released to the market on the expectation prices could go higher. +44 171 542 7714.</p>
</text>
